`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection` inject array by published version:

- 0.1.2-rc.1, 0.1.3-alpha.2: `["webServer", "credentials"]`
- 0.1.5-alpha.1, 0.1.5-alpha.2, 0.1.5-rc.1, 0.1.5-rc.2: `["credentials"]`

`@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-loop` setup call: 1-arg through 0.1.3-alpha.2
(`setup?.(prepared.agent.ctx)`); two-arg (`prepared.agent.ctx, prepared.agent`)
in every 0.1.5 build. No published host version combines the two-arg contract
with a working `connection.rpc.handle` from an external plugin row — the
`internal/get` seam in `packages/runtime/src/plugin/host.ts` is the plugin-side
compatibility for the 0.1.5+ published dists.
